{"4845880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mothman: Shadows of Point Pleasant", "steam_appid": 4845880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE INVESTIGATION BEGINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a series of brutal murders and unexplained child disappearances plague the small town of Point Pleasant, West Virginia, a former military investigator is sent to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine investigation quickly descends into a nightmare of missing persons, government cover-ups, UFO sightings, and encounters with a creature that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The townspeople whisper about a winged figure with glowing red eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They call it the Mothman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the body count rises and more children vanish without a trace, you must follow the evidence wherever it leads, even if that path takes you beyond the limits of human understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person horror investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven campaign inspired by the Mothman legend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Point Pleasant, forests, abandoned buildings, TNT bunkers, and secret facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and uncover hidden clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth encounters against hostile entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use firearms to defend yourself against hostile entities and experimental creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management and item collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph clues and gather evidence during your investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect notes, documents, and evidence to uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter UFOs, cryptids, paranormal phenomena, and government conspiracies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple interconnected locations and story chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and cinematic presentation</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE INVESTIGATION BEGINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a series of brutal murders and unexplained child disappearances plague the small town of Point Pleasant, West Virginia, a former military investigator is sent to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine investigation quickly descends into a nightmare of missing persons, government cover-ups, UFO sightings, and encounters with a creature that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The townspeople whisper about a winged figure with glowing red eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They call it the Mothman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the body count rises and more children vanish without a trace, you must follow the evidence wherever it leads, even if that path takes you beyond the limits of human understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person horror investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven campaign inspired by the Mothman legend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Point Pleasant, forests, abandoned buildings, TNT bunkers, and secret facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and uncover hidden clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth encounters against hostile entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use firearms to defend yourself against hostile entities and experimental creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management and item collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph clues and gather evidence during your investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect notes, documents, and evidence to uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter UFOs, cryptids, paranormal phenomena, and government conspiracies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple interconnected locations and story chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and cinematic presentation</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A former military investigator travels to Point Pleasant, West Virginia, to solve a series of murders and child disappearances. Follow the legend of the Mothman into secret underground facilities, government conspiracies, and unimaginable horrors hidden beneath America.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845880/f9aabcd7382587c6ac5d2283a7f89469231b2282/header.jpg?t=1782367229", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845880/79014f77d0496cb920cc3673683052b080624fce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782367229", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845880/79014f77d0496cb920cc3673683052b080624fce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782367229", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25  GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro